  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Grit::Commit/a86fa568885cf4b704bb7c597e04f3b1b208122d</id>
    <link type="text/html" rel="alternate" href="https://github.com/anomalyco/models.dev/commit/a86fa568885cf4b704bb7c597e04f3b1b208122d"/>
    <title>
        Revert &quot;fix: Missing model `claude-mythos-5-1`&quot; (#11327)
    </title>
    <updated>2026-10-24T03:50:24Z</updated>
    <media:thumbnail height="30" width="30" url="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63023139?s=30&amp;v=4"/>
    <author>
      <name>rekram1-node</name>
      <uri>https://github.com/rekram1-node</uri>
    </author>
    <content type="html">
      &lt;pre style=&#39;white-space:pre-wrap;width:81ex&#39;&gt;Revert &amp;quot;fix: Missing model `claude-mythos-5-1`&amp;quot; (#11327)

Claude Mythos 5.1 is a gated research preview: Anthropic grants access at its
discretion, so almost nobody calling Anthropic&amp;#39;s API can use it. Clients list
every provider model, so people would pick it and get an access error. This
removes the lab and provider files added in https://github.com/anomalyco/models.dev/pull/11062 and adds an AGENTS.md rule
not to add restricted models until the host makes them generally available.

This reverts commit 16e8e2175d3d063aecb13e482f0fabbe4c980e05.&lt;/pre&gt;
    </content>
  </entry>
